<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n62062" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λατρ-εύω</span></b> , Elean <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λατρείω</span></b>  (q.v.), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>work for hire</i> or <i>pay</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sol.
				13.48
			</span></i>: <i>to be in servitude, serve</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				3.1.36
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρά τινι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Apollod.
					2.6.3
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ. τινί</span>
			<i>to be subject</i> or <i>enslaved to</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				35
			</span></i>, etc.: c. acc. pers., <i>serve</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>IT</u>
				1115
			</span></i> (lyr.), f.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>El.</u>
				131
			</span></i>: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ. πέτρᾳ</span>, of
			Prometheus, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				968
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μόχθοις λατρεύων τοῖς ὑπερτάτοις
					βροτῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OC</u>
					105
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ. νόμοις</span>
			<i>obey</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Ages.</u>
				7.2
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ. καιρῷ</span>, =
			Lat. <i>temporibus inservire</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ps.-Phoc.
				121
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ κάλλει λ.</span>
			<i>to be devoted to</i> . . , <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				10.57
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ. ἡδονῇ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Nigr.</u>
					15
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>serve</i> the gods <i>with prayers and sacrifices</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ. Φοίβῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ion</u>
					152
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.): c. acc. cogn., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόνον λ. τινί</span>
			<i>render due</i> service, ib.<i><span class="en">
				129
			</span></i> (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόνον . . τόνδ᾽ ἐλάτρευσα θεᾷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					2.1378
				</span></i>
			.</div>
